[[File:Juvenile custodian stalker icon.png|left]]
'''Juvenile custodian stalkers''' are [[slayer monster]]s that require level 54 [[Slayer]] to kill. They are found in the [[Stalker Den]] near [[Auburnvale]]. They are similar to the stalker creature fought during the quest [[Shadows of Custodia]]. Unlike their older counterparts, they do not drop any uniques aside from [[broken antler]]s.

The [[custodian stalker]] has a special attack where they stomp the ground and douse the player in spores. The special attack is performed once the custodian stalker reaches 20% HP. This attack can be blocked by Protect from Magic and causes the player to [[bleed]] for 9 damage over 15 game [[Game tick|ticks]] (9 seconds). It is the same as the [[bleed]] applied by [[Vardorvis]]' attacks and can stack.
